{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8 'runtimes\\\\CODEX.md'; Get-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8 'runtimes\\\\runtime-contract.json'; Get-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8 'standards\\\\AUTHORITY_INDEX.json'\"","aggregated_output":"# CODEX Runtime\n\n当前 Story OS 版本以根目录 `story_os_manifest.json` 为准。\n\nCodex 是文件原生全自动生产 runtime。用户明确“全自动执行”后，正常节点不反复询问继续。\n\n一键入口：\n\n```bash\npython episodes/_system/story_os.py run <episode_dir> --full-auto\n```\n\n当前契约中的“完成”不再等于 Codex worker 进程返回 0。worker 返回后必须执行 deterministic postflight；最终只允许：`COMPLETE / PAUSED / BLOCKED`。\n\n正式生图使用：\n\n```bash\npython episodes/_system/codex_subscription_image.py generate-for-frame <episode_dir> --frame NN --prompt-file <prompt.txt> --output <candidate.png> --log <log.jsonl>\n```\n\nbackend 会：订阅态 image_generation → 保存 raw → 读取 production ledger canvas → 规范化成精确 1080×1350 或 1080×1920 → 再交给 production ledger。\n\n全自动批准必须使用 delegated provenance：\n\n```bash\npython episodes/_system/delegated_approval.py record <episode_dir> story_lock\npython episodes/_system/delegated_approval.py record <episode_dir> visual_lock\n```\n\n它不会写 `user_approved=true`。Evidence Gate 接受两条真实路径：`direct_user_review` 或 `delegated_auto_review + continuous_execution_authorized`。\n\n最终 delegated ZIP 必须使用真实 publish 资产，禁止把 approved base 静默当 publish。ZIP 必须包含正文、封面、字幕、发布文案、传播卡、release manifest、text audit、checksums 和 delegated report。\n\r\n{\n  \"schema_version\": 3,\n  \"story_os_version\": \"2.0.3.4\",\n  \"name\": \"Multi-Runtime + Incremental Workspace Closure\",\n  \"state_source\": \"meta/episode-state.json\",\n  \"creative_authority\": \"standards/制作规范_正式版.md\",\n  \"routing_order\": [\n    \"CODEX\",\n    \"WORK\",\n    \"WEB\"\n  ],\n  \"routing\": {\n    \"CODEX\": {\n      \"target\": \"deterministic_full_auto_file_pipeline\",\n      \"checkpoint\": \"repository\",\n      \"orchestrator\": \"episodes/_system/codex_auto_orchestrator.py\",\n      \"image_backend\": \"episodes/_system/codex_subscription_image.py\",\n      \"canvas_normalizer\": \"episodes/_system/canvas_normalize.py\",\n      \"postflight_required\": true,\n      \"final_zip\": \"required\"\n    },\n    \"WORK\": {\n      \"target\": \"full_auto_workspace_pipeline\",\n      \"checkpoint\": \"workspace_and_repository_when_writable\",\n      \"final_zip\": \"required_when_tools_allow\"\n    },\n    \"WEB\": {\n      \"target\": \"continuous_best_effort_with_resume\",\n      \"checkpoint\": \"conversation_and_repository_when_writable\",\n      \"final_zip\": \"best_effort_only_when_tools_allow\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"common_rules\": {\n    \"do_not_create_second_episode_stage\": true,\n    \"do_not_duplicate_creative_rules_per_runtime\": true,\n    \"explicit_full_auto_request_is_continuous_execution_authorization\": true,\n    \"do_not_claim_user_personally_reviewed_unseen_assets\": true,\n    \"delegated_auto_review_is_not_direct_user_review\": true,\n    \"delegated_approval_is_valid_when_continuous_execution_authorized\": true,\n    \"calibration_before_batch\": true,\n    \"visual_admission_before_batch\": true,\n    \"max_content_repair_per_frame\": 1,\n    \"reuse_locked_assets\": true,\n    \"minimal_edit_protocol\": true,\n    \"stable_evidence_gate\": \"episodes/_system/evidence_gate.py\",\n    \"worker_return_code_is_not_completion\": true,\n    \"completion_states\": [\n      \"COMPLETE\",\n      \"PAUSED\",\n      \"BLOCKED\"\n    ],\n    \"fresh_isolated_frame_semantic_critic\": true,\n    \"sha_bound_frame_review_required\": true,\n    \"release_must_include_frame_reviews\": true,\n    \"minimal_closure_default\": true,\n    \"incremental_closure\": \"episodes/_system/incremental_closure.py\",\n    \"incremental_frame_review\": \"episodes/_system/incremental_frame_review.py\",\n    \"local_media_workspace\": \"episodes/_system/media_workspace.py\",\n    \"full_review_escalation_dirty_ratio\": 0.25,\n    \"frozen_evidence_media_paths_immutable\": true\n  }\n}\n\r\n{\n  \"schema_version\": \"1.0\",\n  \"story_os_version\": \"2.0.3.4\",\n  \"purpose\": \"Routing only. This file does not create creative rules or a second authority.\",\n  \"precedence\": [\n    \"canonical\",\n    \"active_subordinate\",\n    \"series_overlay\",\n    \"reference\",\n    \"superseded\"\n  ],\n  \"documents\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"standards/制作规范_正式版.md\",\n      \"authority\": \"canonical\",\n      \"scope\": \"global\",\n      \"active\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"standards/抖音推流评分与发布后漏斗规范_V1.4.md\",\n      \"authority\": \"active_subordinate\",\n      \"scope\": \"distribution_and_post_publish\",\n      \"active\": true,\n      \"supersedes\": [\n        \"standards/抖音推流评分与发布后漏斗规范_V1.2.md\",\n        \"standards/抖音推流评分与发布后漏斗规范_V1.3.md\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"standards/抖音推流评分与发布后漏斗规范_V1.2.md\",\n      \"authority\": \"superseded\",\n      \"scope\": \"distribution_and_post_publish\",\n      \"active\": false,\n      \"superseded_by\": \"standards/抖音推流评分与发布后漏斗规范_V1.4.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"standards/抖音推流评分与发布后漏斗规范_V1.3.md\",\n      \"authority\": \"superseded\",\n      \"scope\": \"distribution_and_post_publish\",\n      \"active\": false,\n      \"superseded_by\": \"standards/抖音推流评分与发布后漏斗规范_V1.4.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"standards/真实性与共享风格锚点规范_V1.1.md\",\n      \"authority\": \"active_subordinate\",\n      \"scope\": \"capture_authenticity_and_shared_style\",\n      \"active\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"standards/字幕人话化与声音卡规范_V1.1.md\",\n      \"authority\": \"active_subordinate\",\n      \"scope\": \"caption_voice\",\n      \"active\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"path\": \"standards/最终字幕视觉规范_V1.1.md\",\n      \"authority\": \"superseded\",\n      \"scope\": \"caption_visual\",\n      \"active\": false,\n      \"supers