S3/images/visual_test/` is ignored. [Task 1][Task 2]\\n690:- The episodes state machine is `IDEA_LOCKED → STORYBOARD_LOCKED → VISUAL_CALIBRATED → PRODUCTION_PASSED → PUBLISH_READY → PUBLISHED → DATA_REVIEWED`; transitions are adjacent-only and auto-validate before state changes. Use `episode_state.py init/show/transition`, `validate_episode.py <dir> [--target X] [--all]`, and `test_validator.py`. `episode-state.json` is authoritative over README prose. [Task 3]\\n780:## Task 1: Integrate capture-realism and three-shot calibration into douyin-horror-story-pipeline\\n803:- when asking “给我使用指南” after the change -> provide a Chinese guide covering the five entry commands, realism-plan fields, three calibration images, hard failures, and the existing `docs/` landing points. [Task 2]\\n808:- Per episode, record main capture device, shooter/reason, 9:16 constraint, stable/restricted/out-of-control imaging, first-person-device physical explanation, and character/prop/location anchors. Before the normal formal handoff, inspect three existing-P0/four-frame calibration images: ordinary baseline, worst credible condition, first major anomaly; they do not add to default published-image count and may be reused as final images. [Task 1]\\n809:- Hard failure requires regeneration, not merely a prompt promise: unexplained first-person device in-frame, undeclared second camera/drone/surveillance view, unexplained capture-profile drift, cinematic/HDR/commercial look, or unviewed/unrecorded calibration. Allow one content repair per image; a second hard failure is `不通过`/`needs_user`, preserving original and repair record. [Task 1]\\n810:- Recommended guide flow: `选题` → add realism plan → `分镜` → three-shot calibration → `验收`; `自动` does not generate/publish/modify existing files and stops on blockers. [Task 2]\\n1011:- when the user asks “按上面的点，分析下，该怎么优化” -> diagnose the visual carry of the first three images and the comment hook from actual traffic lessons before rewriting the story. When the user says “ok，我已顶板”, treat the cover as locked and provide final publishing materials rather than continuing variants. [Task 3]\\n1018:- The validated content direction is “真实地点 + 科考/监测任务 + 关系人物 + 第3张前可见异常 + 20张内推进”; 20 images alone are not success—《会认人的蟋蟀》 had 66 plays, average browse 4.0, and 52.94% swipe-away. The main structural weakness is almost no discussion (about 21 comments across 11 posts): leave two visually supportable explanations in tension instead of asking directly in subtitles. [Task 2]\\n1031:scope: Continue the S2《种梨》visual-first story through 20-image/subtitle completion, source-faithful scoring, and publish readiness.\\n1052:- Candidate discipline: write a visual-memory sentence (specific object + abnormal change + real-world intrusion) and pass four-frame admission before making 20 images. 《种梨》uses the original’s cart + broken target evidence chain, strengthened visually by red string without reversing causality. [Task 1]\\n1121:# Task Group: aigc-dali-cat / visual-first new-pit direction, release sequence, and range forecast\\n1122:scope: Choose the next Douyin image-story release from live account evidence, keep series continuity without forcing weak material into the calendar, and turn “悬疑感重、画面感太弱” into a testable visual-first new-pit method.\\n1123:applies_to: cwd=D:\\\\workspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\yeqian\\\\aigc-dali-cat; reuse_rule=the release sequence and captured metrics are time-specific; reuse the visual-first gate, scheduling rationale, and interval-based forecast format after checking current Creator Center/report data.\\n1129:- rollout_summaries/2026-08-16T07-26-52-t2Lj-aigc_dali_cat_visual_first_new_pit_release_plan_traffic_fore.md (cwd=\\\\\\\\?\\\\D:\\\\workspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\yeqian\\\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.codex\\\\sessions\\\\2026\\\\08\\\\16\\\\rollout-2026-08-16T15-26-52-01a00977-5c1a-71d3-984f-41cd6bdcd735.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-16T13:37:07+00:00, thread_id=01a00977-5c1a-