the direction before formal storyboarding when image 01/03 cannot independently show the anomaly. [Task 2]\\n1334:- 05d's release set is exactly the 20 `05d_图NN_..._带字幕.png` files. `05d_图20_走不到几步外的门口_带字幕.png` is the formal ending; `05d_图20_倒影慢了一拍_V1已弃用.png` must be archived/excluded, and `_全部20张总览.png` is an 864x1920 preview mosaic, never an upload asset. Use System.Drawing dimension checks for structural confirmation (formal frames 1080x1920), then visually inspect continuity. [Task 1]\\n1343:- All 20 frames having subtitles is not evidence that every earlier visual-drift concern is closed. Recheck current acceptance evidence for previously recorded 05d issues such as the blue/orange spacesuit stripe and centered reflection before declaring the episode fully passed. [Task 1]\\n1347:scope: Inventory unpublished episodes against authoritative per-episode acceptance evidence, drive remaining production in a minimal sequence, and preserve the 07A visual final-review gate.\\n1364:- rollout_summaries/2026-08-14T15-52-59-4hpD-aigc_dali_cat_unpublished_topics_inventory_and_07a_start.md (cwd=\\\\\\\\?\\\\D:\\\\workspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\yeqian\\\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.codex\\\\sessions\\\\2026\\\\08\\\\14\\\\rollout-2026-08-14T23-52-59-01a000fa-0080-7cd1-bb3e-9ad88ebd8b79.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-15T03:43:40+00:00, thread_id=01a000fa-0080-7cd1-bb3e-9ad88ebd8b79, partial: four visual final-review details remain unresolved)\\n1373:- when the user says “继续” while a visual tool is exhausted -> do not remain in read-only preparation; take a clearly labelled, valid fallback step and continue toward the gate. [Task 1]\\n1388:- `view_image` visual-description quota was exhausted before the four 07A details could be inspected -> PIL/numpy checks for size, mean brightness, and dark-pixel share are valid only as structural fallback; reserve visual quota before a visual-review workflow, and leave hats/material/shadows/sleeve-colour unresolved for qu